    "Plan and reasoning: docs/levels/L_PalmKey.md. Build: Content/Python/levels/build_level.py. Preview: art/recipes/preview_level_layout.py.",
    "Greybox: engine basic shapes + SM_GoldenCrate, palette material instances. The art pass (T-020) replaces blocks by id/group.",
    "Terrain = overlapping flattened cones (soft mounds, ~4-8 deg slopes, all walkable) + boxes for rock, ridge, cave and docks.",
    "Water planes never collide. The water itself is one ALureWaterVolume (marker sea_water, T-026): falling in = surface swimming. Every edge you can fall from has a way out within 12 m of swimming (beach, shelf, edge <= 60 cm or a ladder); the preview checks it (levels.layout.water_exit_report)."
  ],
